<section id="About" class="container mx-auto mb-28 max-w-6xl px-6 py-10">
   <h2 class="heading mb-8 text-left text-3xl uppercase md:text-5xl">About Me</h2>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
        <h3 class="heading mb-5 text-2xl uppercase text-secondary md:text-3xl">Personal &amp; Professional Life</h3>
        <div class="about-story-layout">
            <div class="about-story-panel">
                <div id="about-story-rail" class="about-story-rail" role="region" aria-label="Personal and professional stories">
                    <article class="about-story-card rounded-3xl border border-secondary/20 p-5 sm:p-7">
                        <p class="font-plex text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">01 / At Work</p>
                        <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 pb-12 text-base leading-relaxed text-secondary md:text-lg">
                                                        <p>Hello! I’m Cheyenne, a bilingual Product Marketing professional from Vancouver, Canada, now based in beautiful Chamonix. I bring 7+ years of marketing experience across management, consulting, and Product Marketing roles, often in complex or regulated sectors.</p>
                                                        <p>I'm equal parts strategy and execution. Positioning is my superpower: I make the value of complex, traditionally “unsexy” products hard to ignore. I love the puzzle of building repeatable GTM systems that bring that positioning to life.</p>
                            <p>My experience spans B2B and B2C, with a B2C focus. I especially enjoy partnering with sales and support teams, and I’m excited to do more of that work in B2B roles. As a native English speaker fluent in French, I bridge French teams with English-speaking markets.</p>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                    <article class="about-story-card rounded-3xl border border-secondary/20 p-5 sm:p-7">
                        <p class="font-plex text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">02 / Life in France</p>
                        <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 pb-12 text-base leading-relaxed text-secondary md:text-lg">
                            <p>France has long felt like a second home, shaped by several study, volunteer, and exchange experiences growing up.</p>
                            <p>In 2025, what was meant to be a short six-month sabbatical working in the Alps changed everything. I felt more alive and challenged here than anywhere else.</p>
                            <p>So, I followed my intuition, leaving British Columbia's mountains for new summits and career opportunities in France.</p>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                    <article class="about-story-card rounded-3xl border border-secondary/20 p-5 sm:p-7">
                        <p class="font-plex text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">03 / At Home</p>
                        <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 pb-12 text-base leading-relaxed text-secondary md:text-lg">
                            <p>Outside of work, you'll most likely find me outdoors: hiking, cycling, or playing soccer.</p>
                            <p>On rainy days, I'm usually cozying up with a hot cup of tea (Lapsang Souchong, anyone?) while learning something new.</p>
                            <p>My creative rotation evolves constantly, but language learning and multimedia art, like drawing and sewing, are my constants.</p>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                </div>
                <button id="about-story-next" type="button" class="about-story-pagination" aria-label="Next story">
                    <span id="about-story-current" aria-live="polite">01 of 03</span>
                    <span aria-hidden="true">&gt;</span>
                </button>
            </div>
            <div class="about-portrait aspect-square w-full overflow-hidden rounded-3xl">
                <img src="/cheyenne-kuckein.webp" alt="Cheyenne Kuckein in Vancouver at sunset" class="h-full w-full object-cover object-[center_40%]" />
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-detail-section mt-12">
            <h3 class="heading mb-5 text-2xl uppercase text-secondary md:text-3xl">My Skills</h3>
            <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-4xl flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
                {['GTM Strategy', 'Positioning', 'Market & User Research', 'Sales Enablement', 'AI Workflows', 'Lifecycle Marketing'].map((skill) => <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-4xl px-8 py-4 font-plex font-bold uppercase tracking-[-2%] outline-1 outline-dashed outline-secondary">{skill}</span>)}
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-detail-section mt-12">
            <h3 class="heading mb-5 text-2xl uppercase text-secondary md:text-3xl">Languages</h3>
            <div class="space-y-3">
                {[
                    { language: 'English', level: 'Native', proficiency: 5 },
                    { language: 'French', level: 'Professional working proficiency', proficiency: 4 },
                    { language: 'Spanish', level: 'Beginner', proficiency: 1 },
                ].map(({ language, level, proficiency }) => (
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 rounded-2xl border border-secondary/20 px-4 py-3 sm:px-5">
                        <p class="font-plex font-bold uppercase tracking-[-2%]">{language}</p>
                        <div class="row-span-2 flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1" role="img" aria-label={`${language}: ${level}`}>
                            {Array.from({ length: proficiency }).map(() => <span class="language-mountain"></span>)}
                        </div>
                        <p class="min-w-0 text-sm text-secondary sm:text-base">{level}</p>
                    </div>
                ))}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .about-detail-section { position: relative; isolation: isolate; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-secondary) 12%, transparent); border-radius: 1.5rem; padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2rem); }

    .about-story-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(300px, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr); gap: 1.5rem; align-items: stretch; }
    .about-story-panel { position: relative; min-width: 0; }
    .about-portrait { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1; }
    .about-story-panel { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1; }
    .about-story-rail { display: flex; min-width: 0; height: 100%; overflow: hidden; scroll-snap-type: x mandatory; scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    .about-story-card { flex: 0 0 100%; max-width: none; margin: 0; scroll-snap-align: start; }
    .about-story-pagination { position: absolute; right: 1.5rem; bottom: 1.2rem; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; border: 0; background: transparent; padding: 0.25rem; color: var(--color-secondary); font-family: var(--font-plex); font-size: 0.875rem; transition: color 160ms ease; }
    .about-story-pagination:hover { color: var(--color-foreground); }
    .about-story-pagination:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--color-secondary); outline-offset: 3px; }
    .about-story-rail::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    .about-story-rail { scrollbar-width: none; }
    @media (max-width: 767px) {
        .about-story-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
        .about-portrait, .about-story-panel { grid-column: 1; }
        .about-portrait { grid-row: 1; }
        .about-story-panel { grid-row: 2; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .about-story-rail { scroll-behavior: auto; } }
    .language-mountain {
        display: inline-block;
        width: 0.8rem;
        height: 0.7rem;
        background: var(--color-primary);
        clip-path: polygon(50% 0, 100% 100%, 0 100%);
    }
</style>

<script>
    const storyRail = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#about-story-rail");
    const nextStoryButton = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("#about-story-next");

    if (storyRail && nextStoryButton) {
        const storyCards = Array.from(storyRail.children) as HTMLElement[];
        let activeStory = 0;
        const currentStoryLabel = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#about-story-current");
        let scrollEndTimer = 0;

        const updatePagination = () => {
            const nextStory = storyCards[(activeStory + 1) % storyCards.length];
            if (currentStoryLabel) currentStoryLabel.textContent = `${String(activeStory + 1).padStart(2, "0")} of ${String(storyCards.length).padStart(2, "0")}`;
            nextStoryButton.setAttribute("aria-label", `Next story: ${nextStory.querySelector("p")?.textContent}`);
        };

        storyRail.addEventListener("scroll", () => {
            window.clearTimeout(scrollEndTimer);
            scrollEndTimer = window.setTimeout(() => {
                activeStory = Math.min(storyCards.length - 1, Math.round(storyRail.scrollLeft / storyRail.clientWidth));
                updatePagination();
            }, 100);
        }, { passive: true });

        nextStoryButton.addEventListener("click", () => {
            activeStory = (activeStory + 1) % storyCards.length;
            storyRail.scrollTo({ left: activeStory * storyRail.clientWidth, behavior: "smooth" });
            updatePagination();
        });
    }
</script>


